      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "This ensures preprocessing in production matches training preprocessing exactly.\n\n## Performance Optimization in Pipelines\n\nSome pipelines are slow. Profile to find bottlenecks:"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Common bottlenecks: KNNImputer (slow for large data), PolynomialFeatures (explosive dimensionality), cross-validation with large pipelines.\n\nOptimize by:\n1. Reducing data size (subsampling, feature selection before expensive steps)\n2. Using faster algorithms (SimpleImputer instead of KNNImputer unless necessary)\n3. Caching expensive steps (using memory parameter)\n4. Parallelizing (n_jobs=-1 for supporting estimators)\n\n# Cache only expensive steps\npipeline = Pipeline([\n    ('scaler', StandardScaler()),  # Fast, don't cache\n    ('pca', PCA(n_components=50)),  # Expensive, cache\n    ('classifier', LogisticRegression())\n])"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
